+The queue writes these records itself:
+- `copied_<rid>.txt`;
+- `held_<rid>.txt` and `setaside_<rid>.txt`, for runs kept in the holding folder;
+- `recheck_<rid>.json`, which holds validity fields only;
+- `control_due.txt`;
+- `queue_done.txt`.
